            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-four-provinces-feb:grammar-fill:2",
            "text": "One agency, based in Woodbridge, is expected to receive $1.5 million. The agency director says that they will focus their resources on educating the homeless. “We will probably build another school-home with this money,” he said. “A school-home is exactly what it sounds like. It is a school and a home. We have already built four school-homes throughout the county. We get the homeless off the street, and"
